Third-party notices for the okengine documentation site
=======================================================

better-auth (docs structural components)
----------------------------------------
Portions of the application shell — the header tab strip, the docs sidebar, the
changelog layout, the homepage hero layout, and the Features grid component —
were adapted from the better-auth documentation application:

  https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth

